OL,3,AFarage denies wrongdoing over foreign
OL,4,Adonor talks as he is questioned by
OL,5,ALaura Kuenssberg
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage denies
OL,8,Fwrongdoing over foreign donor talks as
OL,9,Fhe faces questions from Laura
OL,10,FKuenssberg - watch live at the top of
OL,11,Fthe page
OL,13,FIn the pre-recorded interview, Farage
OL,14,Fsays he "frankly wasn't listening"
OL,15,Fduring a conversation with an
OL,16,Fundercover reporter - he earlier said
OL,17,Fhis party had "done nothing wrong"
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
